sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant L as Locomotion
  participant P as Plate
  participant C as Screw
  participant F as Fastening
  participant K as Live camera
  participant Lt as Stack light

  Op->>S: START
  S-->>Lt: LIGHT: steady green
  Note over S,K: Start at bottom left. The camera sits in an enclosure with its own light, and streams to the operator screen the whole run.
  Note over S,K: Row 1, spot 1 (route map)
  S->>L: CMD_START (drive to spot 1)
  L-->>S: DONE (on crest, at right spot)
  S->>P: CMD_START
  P->>K: is the plate in fastening position?
  K-->>P: YES, plate arrived
  P->>K: is the placement good? (with tripwire)
  K-->>P: YES, approved
  P-->>S: DONE
  S->>C: CMD_START
  C->>K: are the plate and screw both in the right spot?
  K-->>C: YES, both in position, ready to fasten
  C-->>S: DONE
  S->>F: CMD_START
  F->>K: take photo of fastened screw
  K-->>F: photo accepted
  F-->>S: DONE (torque OK, photo accepted)
  Note over S,K: More spots in this row, so drive straight
  S->>L: CMD_START (drive to spot 2)
  L-->>S: DONE
  Note over S,K: Spots 2 to n repeat Plate, Screw, Fastening
  Note over S,K: End of row, more rows left
  S->>L: CMD_START (turn right twice)
  L-->>S: DONE (turned, front sensor on next crest)
  Note over S,K: Row 2 runs the opposite direction. Its turn at the end will be left twice.
  Note over S,K: After the last spot of the last row the run is complete.
  S-->>Lt: LIGHT: flashing green
